#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's something so cheerful and jaunty about the figure you see before you almost feel like you've stumbled onto the set of a gameshow. This is truly one Sassy Chap."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Welcome, welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/17
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I am the Sassy Chap, mascot and possible owner of Sassy Chap Games LLC."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/28
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Here's where we'll put my greeting and introduction, explaining all the deep <w>LORE</w> behind the Sassy Chap."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look kinda like the ironing-board guy."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? Is this placeholder text?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "No relation."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Placeholder text? Where? Let me at it!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We here at Sassy Chap Games LLC are sticklers for quality!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I may not be the star of <i>this</i> game as it is our first, but just you wait."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "The next game will be called 'The Legend of Sassy 2: Chap's Awakening' and will feature my quest to uncover my holy backstory."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't believe you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there a 'Legend of Sassy 1'?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's what I've been telling them!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I fear you may be right."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Don't be silly, of course there isn't."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And here's where we'll have the Chap introduce the concept of the dating game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay this definitely seems like placeholder text."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the dating game? I thought I was already playing it?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you just going to have silly dialogue this whole time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Not. At. All."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Sometimes the Chap refers to himself in the third person."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "...and describes what he's doing before he does it..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "No, this one is slightly different!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Yabsolutely."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You have found one of the secret dateables in the game - the Developers!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I am not a developer myself, merely a mascot."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But this is hard work too! I'm considered an asset!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, a .png maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem like a real hard worker."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Mayhaps! Mayhaps I am several DOZEN pngs plus some ogg files AND even lines of text in a program called ink!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But you my friend are also a collection of constituent smaller reductive parts, so <w>BLEH</w> to you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well I am excellent at filling a pipe."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "With bubbles."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "When making this game, we wanted to give players the option to 'Date the Devs' - but we wanted to sidestep the problematic condition that there are many players and only a small amount of us!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And of course, many of us are in happy relationships..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "FOR NOW"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "So we figured a fun way to do this would be for players to 'date' each of us by answering a question about ourselves!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Would you like to play?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/40/s/0 sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/41/s/0 sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, let me know more about you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/42/s/0 sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_intro/0/g-3/c-13/7 sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/c-11/7 sassy_chap/sassy_done_today/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "TTFN!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I had a feeling you'd be back!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/12/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Have I ever told you that you are my favorite player who has ever played this game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/12/b/9/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You've treated those dateables so dearly."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/12/b/10/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Even though you are a right scoundrel..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/13/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "My love, my one, my only! The devs love you but more importantly..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/13/b/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "...I love you so much more."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "My good friend! My mate!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/14/b/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "The devs can't stop talking about inviting you to their next Thiscord meeting."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/14/b/20
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Truly not one to be missed. Those things can be LONG."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You hateful thing."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/15/b/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I hate so much that you are a bad guesser of people who are strangers to you! Grrr! Hatred!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/18/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And you're wearing that Fantastic Red Shirt that we created to make more money!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/18/b/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I mean... fun!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/21/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But enough about you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/21/b/9
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Would you like to play our little developer dating game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would like to use the candy I found to make our relationship better. (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you know that there's a huge bug in your game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to talk about Daemon..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm shrinking! Help!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Daemon is out of the house..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/31/s/0 sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to make you a real Chap!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love ya, Sassy Chap!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to say hi, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just like seeing those who hate me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "... what?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/c-9/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well so am I!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/c-10/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Kiss kiss!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_menu/0/c-12/7 sassy_chap/dev_scoreboard_begin/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ta-ra!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Yes! I have a rich and marvelous backstory."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/12
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I am a Chap."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/20
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I am... quite Sassy..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/28
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And...?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I have a rich and marvelous backstory."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where did you buy your hat?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's in the pipe?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "S..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "leanord..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "empresticot..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Sleanordempresticot!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-1/13 sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/46
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I didn't quite 'buy it' exactly..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It was 'drawn on' as it so happens."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-1/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Same with the rest of me..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-2/13
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "The stiffest and strongest damn bubble bath mixture you've ever seen..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/37/16/c-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Keeps me absolutely <w>blitzed</w> at all times."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/afterbackstory/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You know what... here."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/afterbackstory/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Have some extra dev love points... don't tell the bosses."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/sassy_backstory/0/afterbackstory/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You feel somewhere deep in your soul that you and the devs are getting along just a bit better than you were a few moments ago."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "...tell me more of this."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The dresser is a 'glitch' character named \"Daemon\"."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Dear me dear me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What did they do to you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing much, just said mysterious things, gave me an ending."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You got an ending... that shouldn't cause any issues with blocking progress in any way..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That... seems harmless. So far."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "As long as it isn't an issue with branching dialogue, maybe we can let this one slide."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's what we call a 'shippable bug'. And it's perfectly fine and natural for game companies to do this."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thank you for reporting it - I suppose it will find a way to work itself out."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest/0/c-0/23/c-0/47
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I would advise against talking with it again."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Again?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/19
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Has anything changed?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They seem to really want to cause problems for you, in a creepy way."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Eugh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I knew there would be consequences..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I got some collectables?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They are really kinda scary..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Those things are delicately balanced!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I'm sorry - we did not intend for spoopiness in this wholesome game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "The dresser, um, was 'cut content.'"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ugh... the developers felt there were too many overlapping characters who were all about 'fashion' and 'grooming'... and so Deenah the dresser was removed from the game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds like it makes sense..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aw. Deenah sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "There are only so many times you can have a dateable tell the player to take care of their appearance..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "3 times."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "She... might have been. If they had given her a chance..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But still - that 3d dresser model is right next to the bed!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's tragic... but I do have a game that I'm ostensibly responsible for."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Let me see if I can dig anything up to help...."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Sassy Chap closes his eyes, thinking hard for a few moments."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/54
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ha ha!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/62
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What's this variable?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/70
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's called \"bug_patch\"."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/78
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It must be here to patch the bug!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/89
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well, let me go ahead and set that from 'false' to 'true'! Take that, \"Daemon\"!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/101
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I want that bug <i>out of this house</i>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/109/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I be on the payroll?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/110/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got it, boss!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_2/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thank you for your diligence!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh dear! You have become quite small indeed!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Or well... the fixed camera height that gives the illusion of POV has been lowered."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Either way - disturbing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you fix it?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I can fix everthing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about that typo?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please do!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Too late for that..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Sassy Chap looks past you, his eyes glazing over as he manages processes you can't see."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I'm coding... coding... fixing... tracking... testing..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Adding to the budget... and..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You are fixed!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you, Chap."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I need no thanks."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I need this bug <i>out of this house</i>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This latest fix should do that. The name of the variable I created is \"bug_exorcism\"."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I've set it to true."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/49
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It will not bother us."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/57
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Any."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/65
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "More."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_3/0/g-0/c-1/73/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Bye, love!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You've done it, then? We've done it?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, the bug is technically 'out of the house'... but..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Daemon is out of your hair!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's all I needed to hear."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You've done exactly what I asked."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/daemon_quest_4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thank you. We will make sure to put a note in the project tracking software to give you a special thanks in the credits."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "All right! We have an awful lot of lovely people who are dying to get to know you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You've been all up in their business this whole time, but now you get to REALLY find out about them."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Do you want to know the general rules?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, why not!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/date_devs_intro/0/c-0/12 sassy_chap/rules_start/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Splendid!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_return/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hm hm!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happens in general?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many points do I need to win?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I just guessing?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I have a hint?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "When does it end?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many devs are there?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many points per ending with each dev?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "The rules are simple - each dev will introduce and ask one question about themselves."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You'll get to choose from three responses, each corresponding to a Love, Hate, or Friendship ending with each dev."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Then we move on to the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "If by winning you mean find true love and happiness?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "30 points for finding true love and happiness."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Essentially... yes! This is a guessing game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not very fair!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "There are... methods in which you can work some of these out, and you can also reset your score if needed."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "If I were to offer one piece of advice if you're looking for love?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "These are game developers we're talking about - think NERD."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "They aren't going to want to do anything COOL."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You can quit at any time, and at any time we can tally up the resolutions you got towards your current Dev Love Status."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "33! A lucky number."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Or at least that's as many as there were when we recorded this voiceover."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "2 points for a Love ending, 1 point for a Friend ending, and -1 points for a Hate ending."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-7/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Then let's get on with the show!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-7/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Disclaimer - developers who happen to be members of the SAG-AFTRA union will voice themselves. The rest, well..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-7/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Will be voiced by the very sensual RPG beep."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/rules_menu/0/c-7/36
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Not too bad a fate I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/firstup/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "First up, we have..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/play_again/0/14
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Would you like to date another dev?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/play_again/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/play_again/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I see some other options? Like how I'm doing?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/play_again/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I've come up with a new developer!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh! That's your lot!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/11
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "So it is."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/19
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Is it time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/27
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "The Final Boss of Sassy Chap. Are you prepared?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you the final boss?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "I thought you'd say that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Because I'm the one who does all the story programming, which nobody else wants to."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Which means I get final say in what stays and what leaves!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Mwhahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "So."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Right now... it's 2:36AM after a VO recording day and I was able to polish Hanks, Telly, Lady M and Sassy Chap today but missed the milestone 18 deadline by eight full hours."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "My gift to myself is not writing the intricate ink thing I had originally planned for my boss battle."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Is that okay? Can I go to sleep?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go to sleep!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, do the cool ink thing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "hate option"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "We're recording Gaia, Johnny, and Prissy tomorrow. That should be fun."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Goodnight I love you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Ah too late I fell aslep"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "hat e optino"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And... that's it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/devs_done/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "There's nothing left to do but submit your score!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/17 sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/13 sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/19 sassy_chap/dev_william/0/19
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Next we have..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/10
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Hi, I'm Adriel! I was one of the original programmers on this game - I helped create the first vertical slice and set up the groundwork for what this game would become."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/18
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Everything is so very different than when I first started working on it - big shoutouts to everyone who worked on this since then, it wouldn't be what it is without every single person on this team."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/26
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "What an incredible, and long, journey this game has been on!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/34
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "I met Ray many many years ago at GDC, and one time when we were hanging out, he pitched to me the idea of a dating sim game where you could... date EVERYTHING! How could I say no to that??"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/42
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "I'll never forget the first time I laid eyes on our first two datables: Hoove and Harper - it was love at first sight."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/50
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "I was absolutely smitten with both of them, and while I've also fallen in love with every character created since then, nothing will ever match what I felt towards my first two loves."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/58
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "But enough about me, I'm excited to learn more about YOU, my potential date! Would you like to take a walk with me?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Oh. Well then nevermind."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/c-1/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah, c'mon that wasn't even part of the game and you bungled it right up."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/21/c-1/32 sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-4/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's a Hate ending with Adriel then..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "There's a few new places that have opened up nearby that I'd be interested in checking out... looks like there's a new electronics shop, a petting zoo, and hardware store!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An electronics shop? Let's go there - I've been looking for one of those new GTX9000 MegaForce Ultra graphics cards!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope the petting zoo has goats - I love petting animals!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just imagine all the yardwork we can do together with the right supplies from the hardware store!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that sounds nice - I'm at my computer all day for work, so it's probably good to make sure I've got the most cutting edge hardware."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Friends with Adriel! Well done."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Right?? I love goats so much! Maybe there's rabbits? and chickens? and sheep??"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-3/24
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Maybe we can feed some llamas!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-3/32
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "I can't wait to see what animals are there and give every single one of them a pat on their sweet little heads!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-3/43
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Adriel is so very much in love with you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_adriel/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Adriel"
msgid "Yardwork? On my day off? When there's a petting zoo down the street? I know it needs to be done, but I'd much rather go pet a sweet little baby goat."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/21/10
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Oh, hey!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/21/18
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "How are you liking the game so far?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/21/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh my god it’s soooo-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/21/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well honestly, I-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/21/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm I think-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Actually, sorry. Hold that thought. Getting a ping."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "... just need to copy ... this... over... and done!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Sorry about that. What were you saying?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The game is absolutely-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I kinda feel like-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could you explain-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Right, right. Mm-hmm. Yeah, one sec."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Several seconds, actually..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Oh, gotta fix that... wait, they did what? Not again..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Oooookay! Looks like they need me in the back... but..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "I can put my phone on silent... Ok, that should buy us a solid ten minutes. What were we doing?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Have you done introductions yet?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "... no?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/62
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ahem! Let’s start with a proper introduction, then."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This is the venerable Amanda Hufford, our dedicated <i>sleep deprived</i> producer extraordinaire, voice director, writer, script supervisor, scheduler, therapist, hostage negotiator, and maker of spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/81
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "So... many... spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/92
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "If there’s a job to do on the game, Amanda has probably had a hand in it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/103
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Umm aren’t you forgetting something, dumbass?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/111
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Oh right, I’m also a voice actor!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/119
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "How do you forget your own fucking job... whatever."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/130
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And you... decided to take on game development <i>on top</i> of that?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/138
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "... Phoenicia, remind me to ask Ray to put the cryonfloor emoji in the game as a collectable and tag it here..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/152
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Ah shoot we can’t really do that because we don’t own the rights to the art."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/160
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "But we could commission one that’s similar! Let me message Nij."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/179
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "No... more... collectables..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/190
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Yeah - ever since I decided against painted backdrops for the dates we went from 36 non-character art-pieces to...."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/206
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Is that bad?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/214
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "I sleep."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/231
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "That’s fine. Oh, maybe Garrett can just throw in a sad trombone sound or something."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/242
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Ahhh yeah. Sure, sure I could do that. Just let me finish composing about 115 songs first real quick."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/256
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Don’t worry about it Garrett, I got it. What did you want again, a sad whistle or something?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/267
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Robbie, if you start whistling again right now, I will turn this game around so fast, I swear."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/278/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should I just... come back another time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-1/279/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda feels like I shouldn’t be here."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Ah, sorry. We'll figure all that out later. Thanks, guys. You can get back to it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "I keep forgetting it’s not just us around here anymore."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "You know, it's weird finally being able to share a game with you. I mean, you work on something for long enough and it kinda just becomes part of who you are."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "The last couple of years have been <i>Date Everything</i> all day, every day, all the time!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Meetings and emails and spreadsheets and revisions and <w>meetings</w> and hiring and lore changes and casting plus direction and then scheduling and seriously, seriously the <w>meetings</w>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "And after all of that, after pouring everything you have to give into something... you still have no idea if anyone will even like it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So that’s why you wouldn’t let me finish what I thought..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that what you want? Because I can just tell you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Ahh, yeah. Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "You’re sweet to offer, really."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Even if you did tell me, I wouldn’t remember."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "This version of me, right here, right now, just doesn’t ever get to know."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "And that’s ok."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well what <i>do</i> you want?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m just trying to get a specific ending here so if we could move this along..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Look, I'm gonna make this real easy for you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "After you get done here, if there was something in the game you enjoyed, if anything really stood out to you or even meant something to you, let the team know."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Take a little scroll through those credits for the names of all the amazing people who worked on this monstrosity, and if you liked their work, go support them."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "And if you get to the end and realize it just wasn’t for you, hell if you just flat out hated it right from the start..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Just promise me you won't tag me on social media and yell at me about it, okay? Heh heh heh."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Can you do that?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I can definitely do that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m probably not going to look at the credits, but I promise not to tag you in any trash talk."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pass, that’s lame. And you really shouldn’t be so sensitive about criticism-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Then you truly have <i>all</i> my love for it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-12/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Amanda loves you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "A more than fair deal. I’ll take it, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-13/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You have achieved friendship with Amanda!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Amanda"
msgid "Allllllright, just gunna stop you there. You are free to finish that thought once you’re back on the <i>other</i> side of the Code Vortex, thank you so much."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_amanda/0/g-4/c-14/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah bugger all - Amanda hates you. That's one I wouldn't want to piss off..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Andrew Feliciano, the owner, operator, mic adjuster, and button pusher at VoiceTrax West."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/18
msgctxt "Andrew"
msgid "Hey there, you might say I was one of the subcontractors while this house was being built. Everyone moved mountains to make it all happen and I sure hope you are enjoying it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Andrew is a <i>very</i> humble man - we couldn't make this game without his generosity of studio time and talent."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/34
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Andrew did <i>not</i> write this part. I'm adding it after he submitted his text. He can't hear this either so he's just going to talk as if nothing happened."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/42
msgctxt "Andrew"
msgid "What grand experience is on my bucket list? It was in motion to happen in 2008 which was rudely interrupted by my current role at Voice Trax West."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hike Mount Kilimanjaro"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bungee Jumping in New Zealand"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Open Ocean Sailing"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Andrew"
msgid "YES!!! Luckily mountains don’t go away, so it will still be there as soon as I can make it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Andrew is in love with you! Hoorah!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Andrew"
msgid "Good guess! But I’ve already checked that one off! But you should definitely check that one off for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-1/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Being friends with Andrew makes you want to jump for joy!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Andrew"
msgid "No way! I get seasick as hell!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_andrew/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Andrew hates your guess."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ben - uh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Submitted his date after the deadline and it... well."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You'll have to judge for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Here he is!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/42
msgctxt "Ben"
msgid "Ben worked on UI and animation for Date everything"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/50
msgctxt "Ben"
msgid "Ben loves making and playting games at work and with his 2 kids"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/58
msgctxt "Ben"
msgid "Ben climbs (bouldering) and skateboards on his weeks"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/66
msgctxt "Ben"
msgid "He also runs a podcast on AI and ethics called the Machine Ethics Podcast"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/74
msgctxt "Ben"
msgid "Ben may or may not be a robot..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/82
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "So... do you like Ben?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/90/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think this is ridiculous. He should have submitted his bio on time!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/91/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think this is a great idea! I love Ben."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/92/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't really make a decision about him."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah well... can't fault him for trying."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "He does hate you now though."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "He loves you back!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ben/0/25/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "As long as you don't hate him, Ben will accept your friendship."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Rummaging around in the top of your closet, you find a somewhat untidy box of crafting supplies!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It’s Cael!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/26
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Oh geez it’s me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah yes, the aggregated result of many hobbies started and intermittently maintained, still brimming with creative potential!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/45
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "It’s always nice to keep me around, you never know when I might be useful!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/53
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Even late in the game I’m happy to be here to help out."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/61
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Getting to be involved in a huge project like this even in a little support role is really special to me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/69
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "True, you had been stowed away for a little while and joined us when the time was right."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/77
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "You never know when inspiration might strike and what you might need to finish up a project or start something entirely new!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/85
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "It’s also excellent when your hobbies start to overlap, like right now I’ve combined drawing, embroidery, and painting into bookbinding and cover designs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/93
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Lovely! Any other thoughts for your imminent date?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/101
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Oh dear, I guess perhaps let’s consider a fun night in to make some cool stuff?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/109/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I’ll do my own thing and keep you company while you work."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/110/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let’s work on a new hobby, I have all these ideas and would love some help to make it perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/111/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, sounds kinda boring..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Oh sure! Companionable silences can be a panacea on the brain."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Cael considers this companionship to be worthy of a friend!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "Yes! That sounds great! I might have just the thing for you! What did you have in mind? Tell me all about it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This is the way to Cael's heart - it's love!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cael"
msgid "O-oh, ok. Hehe bye then!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_cael/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Not going to work - Cael hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hey you by the coffee machine!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/18
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Hh-!! This is not my fifth cup of coffee, I promise!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Debz here is part of our amazing team of 2D artists."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/37
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Amazing is correct! Everyone is so immensely talented, I'm so thankful to have been able to work alongside them."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You all seem to get along very well as a team. I've seen you in that fancy discord thing where you all can talk."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/53
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Mmhm, one thing you may or may not know is that a lot of us worked remotely on this project."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/61
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "While it was great working 5 steps away from my kitchen and bathroom, it wasn't quite the same as an in-studio experience."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/69
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "So sometimes we would have a voice chat set up for anyone who would like a little company while working."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/77
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "It was important to me that we vibed well as a team, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/85
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Now, speaking of vibing well together... let me challenge our guest here."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/0
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Quick! What is the first thing that comes to mind when you hear... The 1999 hit, \"All Star\" by Smash Mouth. Go!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shrek, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Digimon, duh??"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy, Mystery Men!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't that a really old song?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/7
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Oho, I see you are a person of culture. Of Shrektacular TASTE!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/15
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "But unfortunately, that isn't the first thing I associate with when I hear this song. Don't worry, I still see the potential."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/23 sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/34
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Debz requested that we allow you to have another chance - would you like to take it?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/31/0/s/0 sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm good!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/31/1/s/0 sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I'll try again."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You and Debz are friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-0/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Why don't you meet me at the bar when you're done? We’ll get some shots. I'm suddenly craving a pickle back..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/7
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Aha! I fucking knew it!! A person of culture. Of prodigious TASTE!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/18
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Not many people nowadays know about the cultural experience that is the 2000 North American release of Digimon: The Movie. I'm so happy to have found my people!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/29
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "If you guessed this answer, well, it does take some real attention to detail to be able to figure that out."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/37
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Or maybe you were just lucky..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/45
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Either way, I'm impressed!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/53
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "When you're done running around, meet me at the bar. Next round of potato juice is on me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-1/67
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's true love from Debz!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/7
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Did you just pick that answer because you genuinely like that movie?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/15
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Or did you do it just to flex the fact that you know that Mystery Men was one of the very first films to feature that song?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/23
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "In any case, I haven't watched it. So uh... Sorry if you actually like that movie."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Debz doesn't like that answer you gave... she hates you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-2/42/c-0/34
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Can you step aside? You're blocking my way to the bar."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-3/29/b/1
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "Try again."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-3/30/b/1
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "What the hell. Don't pick this one."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-3/31/b/1
msgctxt "Debz"
msgid "THAT'S IT!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-3/31/b/12
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Uh oh. We better move on before she breaks something..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_debz/0/21/93/c-3/31/b/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's hatred if I've ever seen it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Why it's Devin! A writer, and one of the main people who set us on the path to getting this game funded!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/18
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "Hi there!! I’m Devin, a writer for some of the dateables - mostly Beverly is my gal!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/26
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "I love history, which you may pick up on upon meeting those characters. So I’m gonna give you a little history quiz!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/34
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "Which of these is the true name of the queen of Egypt famed for her beauty, cunning, and relationships with Julius Caesar and Mark Antony?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cleopatra XII Auletes"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cleopatra VII Thea Philopator"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cleopatra V Tryphaena"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "Wrong! You know, Google is free and it’s not like I can stop you from looking it up from here. I mean, come ON. That should have been a gimmie!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Harsh! She hates you though!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "Correct!! Great job!! I’m always happy to meet another history buff. <3"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-1/18
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "And for those of you that just looked up the answer... well at least you’re resourceful!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's true love with Devin for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "Close, but no! That name possibly belongs to Cleopatra’s mother. Her family tree is full of Cleopatras."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-2/15
msgctxt "Devin"
msgid "That, and a lot of really messed up shit I’m not gonna mention cuz it would bring the vibe down. Oh well, that’s history for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_devin/0/21/c-2/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nonetheless - you and Devin are friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh, hey, it's Dom!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/18
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Hey Chap! What's up?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well, we've got our lovely player that wants to know a little bit about you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/37
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Oh, well, uh, I'm Dom Dinh! I'm the writer and voice actor for Kopi, and I'm from all the way in Australia."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/48
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's riiiight! Hmm... you don't really sound Australian sometimes though."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/56
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Oh, big time, I have this quirky lil’ thing of being able to speak in both an Australian and American accent."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/67
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Heck, I even stumped some of the crew when I first met them!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/78
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "I have to explain to a lotta people how I got it, and it’s literally just because of watching and playing so much American stuff... lemme be real though, it was mostly dubbed anime."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/89
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Neeeeerd aleeeeert."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/100
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But, hey! Look at you now, dubbing anime!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/108
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "You know it! LOOK AT ME NOW!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/125
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well, Dom, is there anything you want to do with your pending date?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/133
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/144
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Well, how about we play some video games while we're here? You got some time, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/155
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "What kind of game would you wanna play with me?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/166/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's play a JRPG!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/167/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a tactical shooter game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/168/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You good at handling soccer balls?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Oh, you DEFINITELY know my kinda style!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "I have the PERFECT game I wanna show you... it's one of my favorites... It's about four guys that travel around in a fancy car and demonstrate the true power of bromance and friendship."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-0/35
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "I heard their voice actors are huge nerds, too."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-0/46
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Mmm... I'll have to check that out myself one day."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-0/57
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Dom is in love with you for this answer!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Heck, I could vibe with that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "I have a few friends that would wanna play too; let's five stack this bitch!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-1/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "A five stack of friendship with Dom!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Uhh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Yeah, I don't know where you got that impression from but I think I'll pass for today."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-2/29
msgctxt "Dom"
msgid "Good... luck?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-2/43
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It should be noted that most of us here do not enjoy sports."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_dom/0/21/c-2/51
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Dom hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hey it's Elle!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/18
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "Hello there! I'm Elle. I was one of the artists working under the amazing Erin. It was such an honor to work alongside so many wonderful artists."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Wait. An artist? But you look like a little doggie."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/37
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "What's wrong with a dog artist? There are many famous dog artists. For instance, Andy Warhowl... or Pawcasso!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I don't think that's right. In fact, I think you just made that up."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/53
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "Okay. You got me. I'm not really a dog. But since this is a world where you can date everything, why not choose to be anything I want to be!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/61
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But why a dog?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/69
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "Because I just love dogs! I've loved them ever since I was a kid and the family dog, Lucky, saved me when I got lost and stuck in the woods."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/77
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well, how did that happen?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/85
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "I used to go exploring with Lucky out in the woods. One day, while out, I got stuck in a briar patch and couldn't get out. Lucky went and found my older brother before leading him to me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/93
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Goodness! That's a real Lassie moment."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/101
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "Yeah, it would've been really RUFF if he hadn't saved me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/109
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I see we're back to the dog puns."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/117
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "Hahaha. I'm in such a good mood now. We should hang out!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/125/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go to the park for a walk. We could even check out the local hiking trails."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/126/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who wants a belly rub~?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/127/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a night in, playing our favorite video games?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "That sounds Amazing! Fresh air... sunshine... The outdoors are the corg-key to my heart!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Her heart is full of love for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "WHOA! I said I wasn't really a dog. Bad touch! Bad touch!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Not the way to her heart - it's hate for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Elle"
msgid "That would be PAWsome! I love to play video games. Don't think you can beat me just because I don't have opposable thumbs!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_elle/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's friendship for you two!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Evan Marquardt, Amanda Hufford’s emotional support, co-owner of the recording studio Voice Trax West, sometimes engineering sessions, sometimes running the dishwasher..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "...and sometimes fixing file names buried deep, <i>deep</i> in spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/26
msgctxt "Evan"
msgid "Thanks Chap. It’s great to be a part of this!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/34
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You are incredibly helpful dealing with tens of thousands of lines recorded by an indie studio."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/42
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Your assiduousness in editing each take is much appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/50
msgctxt "Evan"
msgid "When I’m not recording voice actors pretending to be toasters, I’m planning my next vacation. Can you guess my favorite country I’ve visited so far?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Morocco."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Spain."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kiribati."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Evan"
msgid "Yes! The food, the people, the scenery... What’s not to love?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Spitting camels comes to mind..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Evan loves you and Morocco!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Evan"
msgid "I haven’t been yet, but it’s on my list!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "¡Sí! Qué mágico."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-1/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Evan y tu estan amigos."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This one Evan wrote the note - <i>Kiribati is pronounced kee-ruh-bas not bati :-)</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-2/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "<i>Though he should know you as the player aren't voiced... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-2/23
msgctxt "Evan"
msgid "Great for Gilligan’s Island. Me? Not so much."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-2/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Three-hour tours can be... fun!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_evan/0/21/c-2/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nonetheless - Evan can't stand your answer and hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's Garrett! Lead Audio Designer and Composer of far too many songs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/18
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Yo whuddup. I’m admittedly not a very emotional person with most things, but I express my emotions through my music."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/26
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Speaking of which, can you guess the one film soundtrack that is guaranteed to make me cry without question every single time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pirates of the Caribbean."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Blair Witch Project."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-0/13
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Yeah, that’s it! Everyone loves John Williams—and for good reason—but my favorite work of his is E.T., hands down."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "The word \"genius\" hardly even begins to describe it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Music to my ears - it's love!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-1/13
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Oh man, what a great movie—one of my all-time favorites—and an amazing soundtrack. Absolutely stellar themes from Hans Zimmer & Klaus Badelt."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "That’s not the one I’m thinking of though!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Still - he wants to be friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Garrett"
msgid "Hmm, I don’t recall there being music in that one..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_garrett/0/21/c-2/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Your lack of musical knowledge causes Garrett to irrevocably hate you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/10
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Hey, I'm Greg! I helped build the original prototype of this game with Adriel Wallick many, many years ago."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/18
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Since then I've been extremely busy making more games like Murder of Sonic The Hedgehog and Nova Island."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/26
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Omg speaking of! Are you a Sonic fan?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've played them."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I hate Sonic"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Aaaa I knew we were gonna be great friends! What's your favorite game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sonic Adventure 2"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like the old Genesis games"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like the super fast 3D ones"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really play I just think he's super cool"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Chef's kiss. Absolute classic."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "You truly are one with good taste."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Good taste is the way to true love with Greg."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "A connoisseur of the classics! Of course I can appreciate that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Of course! The flashier the better, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-0/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Wow, a rare breed! I love the comics and the movies too though, so I get it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Well if you're enjoying this game, you should check out Murder of Sonic too!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "It's a silly murder mystery visual novel with some fun gameplay. I think you'd like it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Merely playing Sonic is not enough to pierce Greg's heart - you are friends though!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-1/40
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Anyway, looks like it's time for me to go. Have a good one!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Hahaha! Well it's ok to be wrong."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You hate Sonic. Greg hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/21/c-2/32
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Weeelp, looks like it's time for me to be literally anywhere else. Later!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Sonic led to Greg's interest - but choosing the one that wasn't his favorite means you are merely friends."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_greg/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Greg"
msgid "Well it was super nice talking to you. Hope you enjoy the rest of this game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Jamie, our External Producer from Team17! They're not evil at all... Wait, did I say that out loud?!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/21
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "...and I told that particular Risk, if they keep acting up, they'll turn into an issue before you can say Spreadsheet!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/29
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Oh hello! Don't mind me, I'm just sweeping up some last-minute risks on the project before we ship it off to our lovely players."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Psst, Jamie, the game has already shipped, we're live!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/45
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Well of course we are, I knew that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/53
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Now quickly distract the players with that question I sent you while I sneakily sweep some things past QA!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/67
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "We're live?! Oh gosh, no! I'm not ready yet!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/81
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Take a breath Penelope!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/89
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "<i>Right behind ya Jamie.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/106
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Alright, so here's the question."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/114
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Video games can take a long time to make so which one of these statements happened to Jamie during development?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/122/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He broke his tooth by actually slipping on a banana while holding a big bowl of hot soup."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/123/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He became a godfather, a fiancé, and the owner of all base 102 Pokemon cards."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/124/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He finally learnt how to do a cartwheel, into a handstand, and finish with a backflip all while holding his breath"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/10
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Phew, made it back, only to tell you that you are completely..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Wrong! Who slips on a banana anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yo! I heard banana and peel at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You got something for me or what bro?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/51
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "False alarm Cam, maybe next time."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/59
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ah beans."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/76/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's hate for you and Jamie - though Cam still loves you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/77/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's hate for you and Jamie - though there's still hope for you and Cam."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/78/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's hate for you and Jamie - though you and Cam are still cool."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-0/79/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's hate for you and Jamie - Cam still hates you too! Hah!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-1/10
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Hey! I made it back just in time to hear your answer."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "You got it right! All of these happened during our Pre-Production phase of the project."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-1/35
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Incredible! Jamie loves you - and I won't tell his fiancée a thing..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-2/10
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Nice, I heard your answer on my way back."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Jamie"
msgid "Thanks for choosing this, it may be completely wrong, but I appreciate you thinking so highly of me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jamie/0/21/c-2/35
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Being friends with Jamie helps him complete his checklist nonetheless!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's Jane - a student who found some extra time to help us out with programming!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/18
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Hello there! I'm Jane- a programmer on the project, someone who has \"gremlin energy\", and a general menace who haunts the metaphorical studios of Sassy Chap Games."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/26
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "You may know me from absolutely nothing, as this is my first foray into development on games with actual funding! and manpower! and interest!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/34
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "But anyways, onto the question: Can you guess which of these two statements is a lie?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You created the world's first Date Everything OC by complete accident."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You hid an image of Goku in a bug report screenshot."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trick question - False!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Wrong! Her name is tresta test, and she's a tangible manifestation of the concept of development hell."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "At this point I'm not sure if she's canon or not, but it's funny, so who cares?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Hopefully you never see her, she'll only show up if something's gone horribly wrong."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/34
msgctxt "Tresta"
msgid "You can't hide me forever!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We can, and we will! Back to the dungeon with you, harridan!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/59
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Well, still a good guess. Good luck on your next dev date!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-0/76
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Friends with Jane is a very good thing."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Correct! They still haven't noticed yet."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "I'm not gonna say where it is, in case they read this, but rest assured it still exists in our bug-tracker somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-1/23
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Great guess though, doing anything later?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-1/40
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Jane loves you! And what was that about hiding... something?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-1/48
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "There is no trick question, this is a—"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-2/26
msgctxt "Jane"
msgid "... and how would false even be an answer? At least listen to the question!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jane/0/21/c-2/43
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Programmers enjoy precision. Jane hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's SopheeJay - our 3d artist. She built your house single handedly!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/18
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "Hey there! I'm a 3D artist so I'm inspired by a lot of different things, but there's something in particular that I love most of all."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/26
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "What do I believe is the greatest media of all time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shrek 2"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fable"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Call of Duty: Black Ops"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "Absolutely yes. It is a masterpiece in every single way and that's just a fact."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-0/18
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "the pure magnificence of it will continue to make me emotional every time I watch it. and i watch it regularly lol"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's true - it has come up quite regularly in meetings. Jay loves the ogre and she loves you, too!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "Totally a big inspiration and a British classic, but not the mightiest!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Alas - merely friends with Jay!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "SopheeJay"
msgid "Ew. Realism."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We'll have none of that nonsense here!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay/0/21/c-2/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We hate it - and Jay hates you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/10
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "Hello! I’m Jay (@jayperior), one of the writers of this game. I hope you enjoy your time with the dateables I wrote."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/21
msgctxt "Hero-hime"
msgid "<i>Otousan!</i> Let’s play a few sets!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/29
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "I miss playing tennis, Hero-hime."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/37
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "... When was the last time I saw the sun?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/45
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "Uh oh. Everything will be okay! I’ll go get Shadowlord, he’ll know what to say!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/59
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "Hey... what do you think about anime?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anime is dumb."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I need to watch more."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-0/13
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "Why are you talking to me then? Bye."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "With that kind of insensitivity - you're on Jayperior's shit list."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-1/13
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "Hope you find a show or manga to get hooked on! Thanks for chatting with me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Looks like Jayperior is okay with you - friends it is!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-2/13
msgctxt "Jayperior"
msgid "Hell yeah! Thanks for chatting with me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jay_choi/0/21/c-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Now <i>that's</i> paying attention to context clues. Jayperior loves you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's Jonathan - one of our writers!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/18
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "Hello! Aside from writing you may know me from the many <i>Actual Plays</i> I participate in."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/26
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "There's a reason I tend to be behind the DM's chair 90% of the time, and it all started with a single character..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/34
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "Do you know what character was the biggest influence in my life as a writer and roleplayer?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Superman."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drizzt Do'Urden."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The letter A."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "I'm more of a Batman fan but a good character all the same. However, I didn't get into comics until much later."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "An unlucky guess - but you're friends nonetheless!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "Bingo! Drizzt sparked my joy of reading and world building. I began to DM as a means to give players the same excitement I felt reading the Drizzt novels."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-1/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Roleplaying! Jonathan loves it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "A."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-2/15
msgctxt "Jonathan"
msgid "That's a symbol... wrong kind of character."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_jonathan/0/21/c-2/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Jonathan hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hey! Julia, they’re here! Julia?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/18
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Hey! Yeah, sorry, I was just out in the back, slingin’ those kettlebells! What’s up?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "They’re here. Your, um, your date."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/37
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Oh wow, really?! That’s so cool! Hey! You must be my date."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/45
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Truthfully, the most important aspect of the game... is this lovely new human standing in front of us right this very minute."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/53
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh my gracious... That’s so sweet I might vomit."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa, me? Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s some pretty blatant complimenting right there... what’s your angle?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Oh yeah you. Why do you think we did all this?? It’s all been about you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hurling. Like right now, hurling glitter."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Honestly doesn’t taste as bad as I would’ve expected."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/34
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "And to celebrate you, playing, experiencing this world, getting to this point where you get to date US, we’ve got a gift!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/42
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "And, bonus, you get to pick which of these three gifts you like the best. Pretty cool, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Super cool! If only all gift-giving was like that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It would be more meaningful if you knew me well enough to get me something you know I’d like..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh. Interesting. Never been on a date where I got a present. That <i>I</i> chose."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Amen. If I get one more pair of argyle knee socks..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well we're not stealing your data! Absolutely not!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Maybe just a little..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/34
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "No - we aren't. It's okay. I'm sure you'll enjoy something I've got here..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let’s gift it up!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Meh. Ok. If it’s gonna calm you folks down."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-0/50/c-1/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Okay, Sparky, settle down!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Um... to give you a gift, actually."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way! Well, hell yeah, let’s get to it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh huh. A \"gift.\" Gift with a purchase, probably."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Nope, just a normal, well... an awesome, gift. No strings."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever. Thanks for the thought, but I’m good."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No strings. Hm. Ok, I’m in."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I’m... speechless."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Yeah. Pretty... a little bummed, actually. But, we honor the player’s choices, right, folks? So we honor this one, too! Go, O Giftless One. See ya around!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/21/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/35
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Julia is a friendly sort - and she is more than bummed - she hates you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/0
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "So. You can have whichever of these you like!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A Caribbean vacation to a private island with unlimited rum."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An actual vintage railroad spike, covered in rust and dirt and the dried blood of the last person it was used to murder."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A pretty decent oat milk latte. Lukewarm."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An excellent choice. Really the only safe choice."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-2/12
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Although, Julia forgot to mention that the island is overrun with genetically modified javelinas that eat only human hair and coffee beans."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-2/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Ah. Yes. An unfortunate omission."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Julia is nodding appreciatively."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-3/12
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Hell yes I am. Gosh, finally, someone who appreciates unconventional presents."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-3/20
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Did you know that a railroad spike also makes an excellent kitchen implement? Really superior for doing massive kebabs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-3/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without question. This one, given its other mineral accoutrements would probably lend an insouciant saltiness to your dishes."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-4/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Really didn’t think anyone was going to choose this one."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-4/15
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Neither did I. I’m... a little confused, but as a lover of milk- substituted lattes, I suppose I get it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-4/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Little did you know... there was a <i>GOLD BAR</i> hidden in the bottom of the to-go cup!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/gifts/c-4/28
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Splendid! Those taste delightful!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/0
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "So, listen. You’re supposed to get an ending with me, like you got with all the other awesome folks you’ve gotten to know in the house."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/8
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "And the way I’ve decided to do that here is..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Julia mimes doing a drumroll with her two index fingers."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/24
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Just to ask you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/32
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "Did you hate our date? Did ya love it? Do you kind of, maybe, not-so-secretly love me now? Lemme know."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/40
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "And hey. Whatever you choose... you’ve been a blast."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/48
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Couldn’t agree more!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/56
msgctxt "Julia"
msgid "See you for the next adventure!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I liked it! You and I aren’t going to be more than friends, but the date was fantastic!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oof not my style. Wish I could go back in time and not date you. No offense."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You and I will be together forever."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's the spirit! A friend with Julia is a rare thing indeed I must say..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/c-6/13
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah, an unwise choice. Julia hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/c-7/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well - now that's something! Julia is yours, virtually, forevermore."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_julia/0/didjalikeit/c-7/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Her husband Ray wrote these lines."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/14
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's Logan Burdick I'm afraid. He's a terrible writer, and in a terrible pickle."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/22
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Thank God you’re here!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m here! It’s a celebration! Hooray!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't bring God into this!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Apologies."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Now listen to me very carefully. Both our lives depend on it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "O-oh. Ok..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No promises."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I in danger?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "You've always been in grave danger."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "There’s a bomb affixed around my neck."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "The only way to disarm the device is to answer the following questions correctly."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "If you fail the bomb will instantly explode, probably killing us both. Definitely killing me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Or at very least maiming me a little."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "And honestly my healthcare’s kinda sketch right now so I really don’t need the hassle."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Oh and obviously I can’t just tell you the answers or they’ll detonate the device remotely."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait who are \"they?\""
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not good at disarming anything, let alone bombs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "There’s no time!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Ain't nothin' to fret about, homeskillet! Why it's no harder than proving the Riemann Hypothesis!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait the Riemann what?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wonderful, I can totally do that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/c-0/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Look it up."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/c-0/12
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "It's not my fault the public school system failed you. I pay my taxes."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/c-1/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "No. You can't."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/c-1/12
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "It's remained unsolved since it was first proposed in 1859."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-1/c-7/12/c-1/17
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "That's the joke."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Okay! <i>Question One:</i> what’s my favorite flavor of ice cream?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rum raisin."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything sorbet."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cold."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Really? That’s <i>really</i> what you’re going with? Yeesh."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Not sure that sorbet is <i>technically</i> a flavor, so much as it's a different type of dessert entirely."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "But considering our lives are hanging in the balance... here's hoping the judges aren't sticklers for accuracy!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "What was that? Sorry I wasn't paying attention."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-2/c-10/18
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Anyway, hope you made the right choice and didn't just choose an obviously incorrect joke answer for the lulz."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Alright <i>Question Two... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "I wrote a dozen characters in this professional dating simulation, many of whom strongly advocate the sport of cheese rolling. But which of the following characters did I <i>not</i> write:"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "David Most, tinfoilhat, that microwave who yells a lot, Broomby the Talking Broom, that weird gray guy SungWon voiced, or that weird xylophone guy that SungWon also voiced."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Broomby the Talking Broom."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trick question: you didn’t write any characters. You’re a fraud."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "David Most."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-11/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Wait, <i>did</i> I write Broomby? Well, I <i>hope</i> I did! He was just the absolute best, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-11/18
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Legit best character in the entire game. By far."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-11/23
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Still can't believe they actually got Mark Hamill to voice him. So sick."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Who are you, my therapist?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/19
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Seriously? No, I definitely wrote David Most. Like... I poured my whole soul into that character."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/27
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "\"Didn't write David Most.\" Unbelievable. \"David Most\" has Logan Burdick written all over him."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/32
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Just my name scrawled in literal sharpie all over his body. I haven't seen the final character design yet, but Ray promised me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/37
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "I mean who else could've possibly conceived of, \"chocolate-adjacent cocoa-product,\" or \"Augusta, Missouri.”"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/42
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "That's quintessential, unadulterated, grade-A, Logan Burdick prose. They don’t teach you how to write like that in a classroom!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/47
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Or maybe they do; I didn’t really pay a lot of attention in school. I was too busy scrawling my name in sharpie all over my body."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/52
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "See what I did there? Snappy dialogue like that is why I've been paid to write at least <i>one</i> feature film."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/57/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only one? That doesn’t seem like a lot."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/15
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "I said, <i>at least one</i>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/20/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So like what? Two?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/20/c-0/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Listen, it starred Mikey Madison, so I don't think I have to explain myself to you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-3/c-13/57/c-0/20/c-0/15
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Or maybe I do? Either way, I really don’t have time to get into this right now..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/6
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Oh no! We’re almost out of time! <i>Come on come on come on!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/14
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "<i>Question Three... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "<w>The Final Round</w>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "God this one is really, really hard..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Which is <i>undeniably</i> the best Sheryl Crow song. Hurry!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If it Makes You Happy"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Soak Up the Sun"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All I Wanna Do"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Yeah 100% it’s, \"If it Makes You Happy.\""
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/c-14/12
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "This isn’t even worth debating. Anyone who tells you it’s \"Soak Up the Sun\" or \"All I Wanna Do,\" is just objectively wrong. I’m sorry."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Upbeat, carefree, and iconic… just like Sheryl. That must be the answer for sure!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Ah, yes… one of the greatest hits of 1994. But is it the greatest song in her catalogue?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-4/c-16/12
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "I hope you’re right... or I’m afraid neither of us will ever see the sun come up over Santa Monica Boulevard again..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Well that’s it... Pencil's down. The countdown is almost complete now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "In a few seconds we’ll find out if you got everything right."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "I wouldn’t put money on it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_logan/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "That’s not because I don’t believe in you or anything. It’s just ‘cause gambling is possibly illegal in whichever state we’re currently in."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/8
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "You didn’t get enough questions right..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/16
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Luckily for you... <i>this was just a test!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/24
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Man, you should see the look on your face!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/32
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "That said, unfortunately your application to join the bomb removal squad has been denied."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/40
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "But definitely try again next year!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_hate_ending/48
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That probably won't happen, as Logan hates you now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "YOU DID IT!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/11
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "You got all the answers correct and I survived! Hooray!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/19
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "And for that, I think you deserve a reward..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/27
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "...these lawsuit papers."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/38
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Consider yourself served by the Baltimore City Circuit Court."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_love_ending/49
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Court orders and references to specific American cities are Logan's way of showing he loves you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_friend_ending/0
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Well, you didn’t get all the answers right. But you didn’t get them all wrong either."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_friend_ending/8
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Honestly I don’t know what the heck that means."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_friend_ending/16
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "But the bomb didn’t go off, so I’m just gonna call that a win for me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_friend_ending/27
msgctxt "Logan"
msgid "Anyway I’m late for a thing with some people, but it was so great seeing you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/logan_friend_ending/35
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Perhaps you'll be one of those people, as Logan is now your friend."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/14
msgctxt "J Michael"
msgid "Hi! I’m J. Michael Tatum."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/22
msgctxt "J Michael"
msgid "(Please, call me Michael. The J is just to throw off my enemies.)"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/30
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Removing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/41
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "I’m a prolific voice actor, writer and sometime composer who thrives on complicating my friends’ creative projects."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/49
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "I enjoy curling up with a good book before scintillating midnight vistas, stimulating conversation with fictional characters, and long walks in my head."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/57
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "I play piano to avoid social obligations."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/65
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "First, let’s talk literature. My favorite books? No, no, no. Regale me with your tastes. What book series do you most enjoy pretending to have read?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Á la recherche du temps perdu."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lord of the Rings."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/75/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Left Behind."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Plus impressionnant! Few things cow pretentious literary parvenus into stunned silence like a Proust reference. Care for a madeleine?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Not a bad choice, but it must be said the films do make it rather easy to cheat."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "I suggest we leave this one behind."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Next, let us turn to matters culinary. If tasked with preparing a repast of choice, what element would I almost certainly get wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mole poblano."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Consommé."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cocktails."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Alas, even my capacious pantry seldom boasts all the necessary ingredients without a week’s notice."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Hmph. Time consuming, granted. But as I’m never without a ready supply of mirepoix, hardly beyond me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "For shame! My fellow conservatory alumni call me The Maestro of Mixology!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Now a subject near and dear to my heart: music!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "What vestigial organ does a minor 6th chord remind you of?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The coccyx."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wisdom teeth."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Neo cortex."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Precisely where I feel the crunchiest interval."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Perhaps if one added a major 2nd. And played it on the accordion."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Clearly we ought to explore your understanding of human biology first."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well well!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "(I fear that this lad might just be classier than I.)"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Let's see how you fared with Michael!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/0
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "In the words of Jackson Pollock: Love is friendship set to music!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/11
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "<i>This is his way of saying he loves you!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/26/0
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "Mon amie! Let us sip tea together and pick apart the tastes of the hoi polloi!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/26/11
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I feel Michael and I would get along quite well..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/26/26/0
msgctxt "Michael"
msgid "If you’ll excuse me, I fear my exit strategy from this conversation is marked molto allegro..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/26/26/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "He's too nice to say he hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_michael/0/g-2/30/26/26/26/3
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Who is our next victim..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Would you look at that! It's Nick Thurston!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "He's a writer, voice-actor, and creator of the Moonsong fantasy universe!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/29
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Huh? Oh! Hi!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/37
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Didn't see you there! Had my head in a book..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi Nick!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I follow your wife on Insta."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What were you reading?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a huge fan of the Moonsong Podcast!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Hey"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Bombshell, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-1/18
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "She's the best."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I'm halfway through Tadd Williams' masterpiece, The Dragonbone Chair!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-2/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Did you know it inspired Game of Thrones?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-2/23
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I absolutely love fantasy."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-3/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "You... You are!? That means the world to me! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/21/c-3/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I pour my heart and soul into it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "It's great to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nick has been a part of <i>Date Everything!</i> since the very beginning!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Ah, the beginning..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Those writer's meetings in Robbie's garage were a riot."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Remember when I read Hoove's original dialogue out loud for the first time?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "And it was so spicy and raunchy that—"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And thaaaat will be enough of that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Oh. Right."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/67
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "First introductions and all..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/75
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nick is somewhat prone to putting his foot in his mouth!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/83
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I get carried away when I'm having fun!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/91
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Since you're here,"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/96
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid "why don't we..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Play a little game?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/112/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I'd like to just go home."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/113/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's intriguing..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Was it something I said? Oh well!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Nice to meet you anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah, well. That's hate!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "If you win, I'll give you a little kiss..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He leans close and whispers, close enough that you feel the warmth of his breath."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And catch the masculine aroma of his scent."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/33
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "...who wrote that?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/41
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Don't worry..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/49
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "My wife Alex says it's cool as long as we're in fantasy land!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/57
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "And if you get the extra credit right..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/65
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "We can have a full blown makeout sesh."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/73
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "How's that sound?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drool."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just play for fun!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see you more as a friend type."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, daddy."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/c-0/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Hehheh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/c-1/11
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/c-2/11
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Awesome! I feel the same!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-0/c-5/81/c-3/11
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I like the sound of that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Ok! Here we go..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I know this is gonna be tough, but:"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "One of these four characters is one that I didn't actually write!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/44
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Who is it...?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lux! They're way too bitchy for a nice guy like you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Arma. I don't see you writing so much anxiety."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bodhi. Way too many 80's refs for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sinclaire. You seem too... normal to have come up with that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Nope! Lux was me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "They were inspired by a lot of the terrible influencer types my wife has worked with."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Not to mention all those idiot 'alpha male' productivity guys you see these days."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Good guess tho!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I used to have a TON of anxiety, and to be honest I still struggle with it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "But I've gotten better at dealing with it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Some of the things you can recommend to Arma to help her come from my experience too!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "You got it! Bodhi was Robbie's creation!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Nice work!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-9/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Oh you have no idea how weird I really am."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-9/23
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Sinclaire was just scratching the surface."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-9/34
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I see myself as more of a surface polisher."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-9/42
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Like Barsweeeper's Friend, or a good microfiber towel."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-1/c-9/50
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "You really are a weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Well, alas, you didn't guess it correctly."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "No love ending for you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "But that's all good, because I'm in the market for cool friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "And I think you're just what I was hoping for."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Good luck on the rest of your playthrough!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "I hope you have an amazing time!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/60
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "A friend ending with you and Nick - not bad!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/0
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Oh wait - you haven't met some of them..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/8
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Then I'll skip this and do my backup question!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/0/b/1
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "That was an awesome guess."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/1/b/1
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Now, since you've been obedient and paid close attention..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/2/b/1
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Ok... So, since you got that, you're definitely getting that smooch."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/5
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Time to see if you can get the extra credit question:"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/0
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Which of the other devs did I live with briefly in a London flat?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ray."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Robbie."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "TJ."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Souha."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/c-10/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Bingo!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/c-10/15
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "We lived together for a semester while studying at the British American Drama Academy!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/c-11/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "That would have been a TON of fun, but nope! We met in LA!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/c-12/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "TJ is such an awesome person, but we only just met for this game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-2/69/17/13/c-13/7
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Nope! Nice guess though!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/0/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You and Nick will be good friends from now on!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/1/b/1
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "You've been a good little player, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/1/b/9
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Here's a treat..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/1/b/20 sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/2/b/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Nick gives you a tantalizingly brief graze of the lips."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/1/b/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's just enough to make you want to beg for more."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/2/b/1
msgctxt "Nick"
msgid "Here's that little prize I promised you..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/2/b/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's just enough to make you mad he's not a washing machine or something else you can bone."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nick/0/g-3/5
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Now there's a true date with a dev... Nick is in love with you..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/4
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh Nijuukoo!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Don’t be shy, introduce yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/37
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Right. Hi. I’m Nij. Nice weather, huh? I wouldn’t know. I spend most of my day at my desk drawing and my blinds are usually closed because if I open them, all I see is glare on my screen."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nij is the lead artist on this game - which means she designed all 107 characters including myself, and almost all the UI that you see."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/53
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Did she sign up for all this? I think partly she didn't realize what she was getting herself into."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/61
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "It was certainly interesting finding out I was Lead Artist on my very first call with the team. Like, welcome to the team—SURPRISE!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/69
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And we are so glad that you said yes."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/77
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Got thrown into the deep end, but I learned a lot and lucky for everyone I’m perpetually fueled by thirst for fictional babes."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/85
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "So, yeah, if you catch yourself staring at parts of your house for too long, and you start feeling weird fluttery sensations when appliances are turned on, I guess that means I’ve done my job right."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/93
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "But let’s be real, I couldn’t have finished the art without my team of artists behind me. Big shout out to Tay, Pejnt, Renoni, Elle, Debz, Palea, Cael, Helly, Nick, Mel and Shenae. I appreciate y’all so much."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/98
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Excellent! And before we move on, do you have any questions for your potential date?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/106
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Date...?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/114
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Oh, right. This is the dating part. I thought this was another work call."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/122
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Uh, anyway! I guess I have some free time now, so what would we get up to?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/130/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hang out at the amusement park!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/131/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stay in for a game night! Video games, board games, dinner from a Styrofoam box..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/132/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The club! We gotta go out for some fancy drinks and jam out to pumpin’ music with everyone!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "That sounds fun, actually. I guess I could use some fresh air. And we’d have plenty of time to get to know each other standing in line for everything. Okay, let’s go!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You and Nij will be good friends from now on!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Aw hell yeah, now you’re talkin’! And then you can meet my doggo who’s the cutest and bestest boy ever, and you could totally bring your furbaby too, if you have one! It’s a date!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "A very artistic date! It might just be love!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Nij"
msgid "Oh. N... noooo. I feel like you’ve totally misread my character. I’m down for music if it involves nerdy video game soundtracks and exactly zero dancing."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_nij/0/21/c-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You'll be dancing by yourself... as Nij hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/10
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Oh!! Hi there, you’re still around."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Indubitably..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/26
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "And I appreciate the dedication bud!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/34
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "I’m Pejnt, one of the artists that brought this game to life!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/42
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Look, I know \"this experience was so fun\" is a total cliché, but this team brought so much joy, heart and enthusiasm into the game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/50
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "And one of my absolutely favorite things is being surrounded by people who get shamelessly passionate about things with no interest in downplaying or curbing their excitement."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/58
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "It’s intoxicating, being around so many equally driven and busy people!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/66
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Pejnt... I'll turn the microphone to you and ask - is that important to you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/74
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Totally! My friends tell me that if I’m not working on a project or doing something creative with my life, I’m not myself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/82
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And what are some of the things you’re excited about?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/90
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Oh man, so many! Drawing is a clear cop-out, but my recent ambitions have been modding zines, teaching myself 3D modelling and even how to animate!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/98
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "On top of that I’ve been spending a stupid amount of time in tattoo shops both getting inked and learning how to tattoo others."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/106
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "I’m also big on plants! I have an extensive collection of almost triple digits that I’ve been carefully cultivating over the past decade."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/114
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Then we have to talk about home decor and antiquing. Did you know how power crazy one can get when you finally have your own space? I’ve learned things about crown molding I never even thought about."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/122
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "And then there’s the travelling, the pretentious foodie bit, the escape room enthusiasm, and oh, the musicals.. Point is, I’m good at being busy! It’s important to have things to look forward to, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/130
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "So my question to you would be, are you also happy keeping yourself busy? Do you also like to share in and be shamelessly invested in things you’re passionate about?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/138/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah I just like to get kind of involved in things, I don’t understand people who get super hyped about their interests.."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/139/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Totally, cringe is dead, blast me with that open enthusiasm for all things creative beam!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/140/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I definitely love and share the whole ~getting wildly consumed about your passions~ bit, but I hope you also make time to rest and recharge after all of that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-0/13
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Huh. A little bland for me ngl, but you do you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ngl... that was the right way to getting Pejnt to hate you, alas."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-1/13
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "Yesss! Oh I’m excited to hear about everything you have in store for us! Let’s grab a drink and cook up some projects together!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-1/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Death to cringe! Death! Friends for Pejnt! Friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-2/13
msgctxt "Pejnt"
msgid "..You know what, you’re absolutely right, I need to be better about that. Hows about we slow down over a nice dinner together?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_pejnt/0/21/c-2/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "My goodness - that took real empathy. Pejnt is in love with you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ray Chase."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/18
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/26
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "I'm the Final Boss."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/34
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "And you're not ready to face me just yet."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/42
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "I have a query so puzzling, so difficult, that it requires that you meet EVERYONE ELSE here."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/53
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "So prepare yourself for the Date Battle of a Lifetime."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/64
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Bye."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_ray/0/27/75
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "All right. Moving on."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/7
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "Hello! I'm Rebecca!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Before working here at Sassy Chap Games LLC, Rebecca spent 10 years working in corporate jobs - with a background in project management."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/23
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "Yeah... I used to work for... let's say one of 'David Most's colleagues'?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Vague enough!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/39
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "My brother Ray desperately needed someone to help make sense of some really big spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/47
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Spreadsheets are actually 99% of game development... and she came on just in the nick of time."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/55
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "I was only on the game for a few months - after leaving corporate for good I decided to start a career in nursing."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/63
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Her story has influenced one of the characters in the game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/71
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "Okay, enough biography stuff. Date time."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/79
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "I like baking cakes for my friends, and walking around bookstores and buying books."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/87
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "On a good day you might even catch me reading one."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/95
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What is Rebecca's idea of a perfect date?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/103/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Going to a concert or musical and then drinking tea and having dessert while discussing horror movies."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/104/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Building a lego set while watching a movie marathon."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Spreadsheet survey."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "Yay!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's the sound Rebecca makes when she loves you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "Ooooh! Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's something she very much likes doing with her friends!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rebecca"
msgid "What the fuck is a 'spreadsheet survey'?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_rebecca/0/27/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "She left corporate, you dolt! Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/14
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well then, if it isn't Robbie Daymond:"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/22
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Voice Director, Voice Actor, Writer, Creative Co-Lead, and Executive Producer of this very game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/30
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "That’s me! Sup’, duder!?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/38
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Uuuuh... Sup’."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/46
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Nothin’ much. Hey, anyone ever told you, you sound like one of those four guys from..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/54
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Moving on!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/65
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Heheheh... new recipeh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/73
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Are you prepared for your date, Master Daymond?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/81
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Master Daymond? Who told you to call me that?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/89
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You did, sir. In your (<i>checks phone</i>) 3:18 am email last night entitled; \"Call me Master Daymond during the Date the Dev’s Game Show\"."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/97
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Ah, that’s right. Well, I do have my MFA, and I am an experienced masterdater. Wait..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/102
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ah, ah! No take-backsies!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/110
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Gah, dang it. Fine. Hey Narrator, can you say \"Master Daymond\" with that SICK British mid-central, medial A?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/118
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Master Daymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/123
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Can I get that one more time, but, like, 69% sexier?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/128
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "I’ll give you an ABC."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/133
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "MASTER Daymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/138
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mmaaster Daaaymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/143
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mmmmmaaaaster Daaaaaymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/148
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I’ll take the C take. Thanks, JB."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/153
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "When you’re quite done, sir, I believe the Player is ready to begin!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/161
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Oh, shit! Aight!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/166
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Uhhhh, well, Megan gave me a hall pass for this, so let’s make it good! Fire away you sexy lil’ cipher, you!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/174/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you from Doruto!! I’m your biggest fan!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/175/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m a huge tabletop nerd, wanna have a roll-off?!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/176/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you be my voice-over mentor?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/177/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Doruto, huh? Haha! Cool. I mean it does get better after the time-skip, it’s just... I play like, a thousand other roles..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-0/12
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "You know what, never mind. I love that YOU love that show! Can I sign something for you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Oh, heck yeah! Let’s do this!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Roll a 13.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Roll a 7.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Roll a Nat 20.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Roll a Nat 1.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/c-0/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Eyyyy, 11 for me! Nice win!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/c-1/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Gah, I got a 4. We’re both bad, but you’re slightly better bad. Congrats!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/c-2/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Double Nat 20s!! What are the odds!?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-1/12/c-3/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Double Nat 1s?! This is a baaaad omen."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Oh wow, I uh... You know, honestly, I taught acting for a long time; backup planning for how unlikely being a full-time actor would be."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-2/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "<i>i’m such an <i>idiot</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-2/23
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "That said, I’m really enjoying my time as a performer and a creator!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-2/28
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I am <i>beyond flattered </i>, but I’ll have to pass. I can recommend some GREAT coaches though!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-2/36
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "BTW, have you heard about www.iwanttobeavoiceactor.com?!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/27/c-3/7
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Just your friendly neighborhood game dev, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Nice to see you two bonding a bit!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But it’s time to up the ante for our Player."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Robbie, you put a fair amount of your life out there on the internet."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Not as much as I used to, but yeah, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "How about we give them a little quiz about you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Gah, I dunno. It seems like a pretty played-out mechanic for a date."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But <i>you’re</i> writing this, sir."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/53
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "META! I like it. Fine then, quiz away, living-manifestation-of-a-mascot-that-I-conceptualized."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/61
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Of course, Master Daymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/69
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "69% sexier."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/77
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Master... Daymond..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/88
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/96
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Answer the following questions correctly and you <i>may</i> earn Robbie’s affection."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Sounds easy enough."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/109
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "To prevent cheating and searching the internet, you have TEN seconds per question."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/117
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Wait. We don’t have an internal, real-time clock in this game. I mean, I wanted one but-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/122
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Sir!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/130
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Ray said it was too hard to program. I didn’t believe him at first, but it turns out it’s true!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/138
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "MASTER Daymond... The <i>Player</i> doesn’t know that, sir."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/146
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Ohhhhhhhh, the ILLUSION of choice and consequence! I gotcha. Cool sausage-showing, Chap- I MEAN SHOWING HOW THE SAUSAGE IS MADE!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/151
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "LET’S BEGIN!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/159
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Whew."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/170
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Robbie is an outdoor enthusiast. What is his CURRENT favorite pastime in nature?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/178/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fishing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/179/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Skiing!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/180/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hiking!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oooo, not quite. An avid fisherman in his youth, Robbie hasn’t set as many hooks in recent years as he'd like."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Yeah. Someday though... Tell all of your friends to buy this game so I can retire."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Though Robbie does try to go snowboarding every season, he is, in fact, NOT good at it. Last season he almost broke his coccyx."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Heheh. Coccyx."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That’s correct! Robbie is an avid hiker, recently conquering multiple 14ers and the SoCal Six Pack. Not to mention traversing the Grand Canyon, Rim to Rim, in a single day!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "My big toenail fell off."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Up next! Robbie has mentioned that he graduated with an MFA-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "IN THEATRE PERFORMANCE!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That was the ANSWER, sir!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Pivoting..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Though his <i>degree</i> was in theatre performance, what was the subject of his thesis?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "A clue lies within a certain \"sudsy\" character he wrote for this game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/62
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Heeey, since when do they get hints?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Since <i>you</i> inadvertently made the question harder, Master Daymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Mmmm.. fine. But only since you called me Master Daymond."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Lugering Method."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Titus Andronicus."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/85/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Commedia dell'arte."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "An astounding guess! Though well-versed and a former teacher of this comprehensive voice and movement technique, Robbie did <i>not</i> write a paper on it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "These questions are making me loopy!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well played! While The Bard’s first tragedy is mainly considered one of his <i>lesser</i>-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Careful now, it’s mah fave."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/20
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ahem. One of his \"less respected\" endeavors, Titus Andronicus was what Robbie chose to write his thesis on."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/31
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "It’s pretty great for scansion buffs and revenge fans."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/39
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And really, is there any such thing as \"bad\" Shakespeare?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-8/47
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "William ShakeSPEAR! Hah! Oh, I’m saving that one for the Date Everything! time-travel DLC."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "An astute suggestion. While he spent several semesters unlocking the intricacies of mask work and character study under Todd Es’plainin’, he did <i>not</i> write his thesis on it."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-1/c-9/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I’m something of a Scapino, myself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Time for the final round!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "You mean, GRAND FINALE!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Yeah, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Here we go!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I’m so excited."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Robbie may be a well-respected voice actor and soon-to-be multi-award-winning game developer, but he’s also known on-screen as a world-famous TTRPG player!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "He recently joined the third season of the first and most-streamed Grottos and Gargoyles, live-play of all time; Whimsical Knoll."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/56
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What CLASS did Robbie choose to play?!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/64
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "This’ll separate the real nerds from the hardcore dweebs!! <i>he says with love</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guardian."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Enchanter."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Troubadour."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ooo, I can see why you’d make that choice. Robbie is, indeed, a hack-and-slash kind of gamer."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Hiyah!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-10/20
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But he wanted to lean into charisma a bit more for his big G&G debut."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-10/28 sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/44
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This is meant to be <i>fantasy</i> after all."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-10/36 sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/52 sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/44
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Heeeey!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ooo, I can see why you’d make that choice. Robbie does have a flair for spectacle!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "AbracaDABra!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "My word, did you just \"dab\"?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/31
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Like it’s 2015, baby. WOO!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-11/36
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "BUT, he wanted to lean into charisma a bit more for his big G&G debut."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "CORRECT! Although he may have run from the class at first, he always found himself returning to it in early test games."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/15
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Guess I’m just a performer at heart."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/23
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "And it gave him the opportunity to play a character with heavy charisma."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/31
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "They call me The Rizzler, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-2/c-12/36
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It is a <i>fantasy</i> game after all."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Score one for the Chap..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Aaaaand that concludes our little Robbie D., fun fact quiz."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I prefer to call it the \"Fam Exam\", but whatever’s clever."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Let’s see how you did."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Excellent, Player! You got them ALL correct. You truly know our EP, deeply."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/9
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Poopy doopy, squeepy, pee-pee."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/14
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Uhhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/22
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Dang, you really know a lot about me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/27
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "And I’m going to know a lot about <i>you</i> after I check out your playthrough metadata..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/32
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Muuhahaa, MUUHAHAHAHAHAH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/37
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Jk. Tldr. Buuuuut you can share it with your friends for funsies.Yaaay!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/42
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "That’s my favorite part."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/47
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Congrats. You’ve earned the undying love of a married, 40-year-old father of two!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/0/b/55
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "HOMEWRECKER!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Well done, Player! You got one or two of these right!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/9
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Good enough for me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/14
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You and Master Daymond are now friends! Congratulations... I guess."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/22
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thankfully, Robbie has very low standards."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/30
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Low standards?! Have you <i>seen</i> my wife?! She is WAY out of my league."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/35
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Fair warning, Robbie likes to nickname his friends."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/46
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Imma call you my lil’ PeePeePooPoo."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/1/b/54
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It’s not too late to run."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/1
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Oh, I’m quite sorry. It appears as if you’ve gotten <i>all</i> of these answers incorrect."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/9
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Baaaaah, that’s okay! We can still be friends! Ooooor looooooovers..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/20
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Actually, I’m afraid you can’t."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/25
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Gasp! Papa Ray! Just cuz you’re the boss of me, doesn’t mean you’re the boss of me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/33
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Technically we’re equal-owners and co-creators of- Gah! No! NO! I won’t let you trick me into your good-natured trolling!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/38
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "I may not be your boss, but I AM the Director of this game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/46
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "You <i>have</i> to have a Hate Ending."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/54
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Awwwww... I don’t wanna."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/65
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Rooooobbie..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/73
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I know it goes against the conventions previously established by all the other dates, but I strongly feel the mechanics belie my character traits and overall theme."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/81
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I’m the loveable goofball! I don’t hate <i>anyone</i>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/86
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "I know, dude, but you GOTTA... For the good of the game."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/94
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Alright, Ray... I understand."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/102
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/113
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Lovely. Now <i>that’s</i> what I call a healthy working relationship."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/121
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "I'm making us friends anyway teehee!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/138
msgctxt "Ray"
msgid "Rooooooobbbiiieee!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_robbie/0/g-3/29/2/b/143
msgctxt "Robbie"
msgid "Hahahah! Heeeeeee’s a RASCAL!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "It's Sam! No relation to the Sam in this game... pure coincidence I swear!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/18
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Hey, I’m Sam, and I’m part of the writing team! I love cozy movies, beautiful autumn weather, and horror games/movies <i>but I will close my eyes for the scary bits</i>."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/26
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "You may know me from Neon White or Read Only Memories: Neurodiver. I’ve also worked on amazing projects like the Cartomancy Anthology and others I hope to share one day when they release."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/34
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Now that you know everything about me, we can skip the quiz and get married!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/42
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Dear me!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/50
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Kidding! Let’s play a game I like to call: Guess! That! Fact!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/58
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "I’ll give you three statements and one of them will be a fact while the others... Well, kitten, they’ll be lies."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/66
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "I’ll give you a small hint since you’ve been so nice to me: the answer can probably be found on my website (if you dare to visit that wretched place)."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/74
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Okay, let’s begin! Here are your options... (and remember: guess the truth!!)"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was featured on NPR."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am trilingual."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I started making games in 2000."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "That I was! I was super honored to be featured on Latino USA to talk about being a game developer and how I bring my culture into the games I make."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-0/18
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "It was super surreal to show my family and they freaked out for me because I was too shocked to move, haha!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Samantha - she loves you for that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "I wish this were true! I currently only speak English and Spanish, but I really want to practice more languages one day."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's still three times as many languages as I know."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "You are friends with Samantha!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Sadly, I did not start making games at 3 years old. I’m honored you think so, though."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/27/c-2/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Developers hate telling you their age... Samantha hates you now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samantha/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Samantha"
msgid "Wasn’t that fun? Let’s chat again soon!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/7
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Welcome Samuel to the stage. Say hi, Samuel."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/18
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Hi Samuel."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I see what kind of interview we're in for..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Tell the folks at home a bit about yourself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/45
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I'm here for a good time, a long time, and just here in general. Hopefully that's good enough!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/53
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What a card, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/61
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What did you do on Date Everything? Besides punning. That doesn't count."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/69
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I was a generalist, so I helped with everything from adjusting code, fixing bugs, and implementing content like animations. Fun stuff if I do say so myself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/77
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ask our lovely audience a question. Maybe you'll hit it off."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/85
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Oh, sure. Well, we've actually met before, but... I'm having a bit of trouble remembering- what's your go-to game format?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/93/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "When a group of strangers awkwardly play an improv game together."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/94/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sitting down with a controller in hand and playing something slow."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/95/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "High-octane, non-stop CCGs and TCGs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uncomfortably answering interview questions."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I love improv, really, but I'm not a big fan of parties. This one rarely happens to me."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-0/15
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I'm open to it. Let's take it slow and see where it goes?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-0/23 sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Would you say that they're the right person for you?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-0/31 sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-1/23
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I could see this going somewhere, but not right now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-0/39 sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Friends with Samuel!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Like a lot of folks, sometimes I do just want to unwind."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Oh hell yeah. Let's do it. Bonus points if you like eating good food! I'm a passionate cook."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-2/18
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Fantastic. Everyone loves a good cook."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-2/26
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "I said passionate. I didn't say I was good."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-2/34
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But you are in love nonetheless!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/7
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Is this some kind of test?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/15
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "No? Not for you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/23
msgctxt "Samuel"
msgid "Oh, uh, okay. Uhm, well if they like that then I don't know if they're right for the position."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/34
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We'll look over your resume and get back to you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/42
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "We are getting back to you now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_samuel/0/27/c-3/50
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Samuel hates you. Terribly sorry."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Hey, it's Souha! She's a writer, VO director, and game developer across a few different studios, including her own, Truant Pixel!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/18
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Pretty sure I told you to introduce me as Souha, Queen of the Universe, but ok."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/29
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Thank you for that extremely adequate introduction, Chap Man."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/37
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Souha has written for a lot of characters on this project, including much of the narrator."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/45
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Let's hear from a few of her characters now."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/56
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hup!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha flexes, her muscles bulging spectacularly. You get the impression she could crush you with her pinky if she so chose."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/75
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Hyaw! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel removes his hat from his head, bringing it to his chest in a classy gesture that also manages to show off the muscles in his arms."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/94
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Hoo!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/102
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk strikes a pose between the two of them, showing off his magnificent physique and dazzling smile."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/110
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "This world is impure..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/121
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol doesn't bother flexing like the others—muscle is clearly not his strong suit. Still, you get the sense he could ruin your day all the same."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/126
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Yes, she's written some truly formidable characters, strong in body and spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/134
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The moment Souha comes into view, the dateables' entire posture changes. Their eyes find the floor, and an air of despair settles over everyone."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/163
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Say something nice about me, losers!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/174
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "And that includes you too, Narrator!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/185
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Don't think I didn't hear that shit. Try again!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/201
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The moment Souha arrives something seems to shift—there is a divine presence in the room, as though an angel had just touched down from the heavens."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/206
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You only just manage to hold yourself back from falling in love with her on the spot, but it takes a truly heroic effort."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/211
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She is a formidable woman—nay, a goddess."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/216
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Much better. Alright, sound off, dweebs."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/221
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "S-Souha is greatest woman I have ever known. I have often asked: is she even mortal?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/232
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps she is a, uh, Fairy Queen?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/240
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Uh... Souha is like a Rainbow after a thunderstorm, only the rainbow is made of knives-"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/248
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Souha gives Abel a sharp look, and he quiets down immediately."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/256
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...just a rainbow. Pretty 'n lovely and all that."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/267
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk steps forward, squinting at his palm."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/275
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "So... han... very... spank."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/283
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Are you reading off your fucking hand?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/294
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Duncan immediately hides his hand behind his back."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/302
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "You're the hottest babe alive, ma'am! A real touchdown of a woman!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/313
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "That's what the hell I thought. Friar?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/321
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...Our Father of Convection's blessings come in many forms."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/329
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Souha is one of his greatest blessings."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/337
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "...I guess that's good from you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/348
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "I had further appearances scheduled from Daisuke, Tony, Tina, River, Penelope, Betty, Timothy, Bobby, Willi, and others... about 23 or so dateables in all, give or take."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/356
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "But time is getting short, and those windbags really can go on."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/364
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "So let's just skip to the good part."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/384
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "How hard do I rule exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/392/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So hard."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/393/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just a little."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/394/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-0/13
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Oh I like you. You're just so sharp."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-0/21
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Very good, very good."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-0/32 sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "<i>She loves you! You're safe now!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-1/13
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "I'm not sure I like your tone, buddy..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-1/21
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "But you DID acknowledge that I rule, even if it wasn't quite enough."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-1/29
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "So I guess you're cool."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-1/40 sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Friends with Souha! I can think of no safer place to be."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Wow, WRONG! Good job failing that softball question!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/18
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "But I'll give you another chance to win me over, because I'm a generous gal."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/26
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Here's another one—who's your favorite developer?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/34
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "And remember, before you give your answer, I'm standing right here... and I can hear you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Souha, of course."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Souha?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-0/13
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "There you are! See, I knew you'd get there in the end."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "I'm not sure I like the question mark in there... but you know what, passable."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-2/13
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Oh, I get it. You think this is funny."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-2/21
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Well you blew it, buddy. I hope it was worth it!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-2/32
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Enjoy the hate, hater!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/27/c-2/42/c-2/40
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "<i>She hates you... But at least you're still in one piece.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Well I've got to run... game dev empire to run... thousands of episodes of Real Housewives to watch..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "Heavy is the head that wears the crown, etc etc."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Souha"
msgid "BYE!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Souha came onto the project later on in its development cycle, but it's like she's always been here, somehow."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_souha/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Every day has felt like a decade. May God have mercy on our souls."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Who’s that in the corner of the ring with a steel chair? It’s Tay!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/18
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Hi hi!! I’m Taylor (or Tay, if ya nasty) and I’m a 2D artist on the game! I drew stuff! And things!! So many things!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/26
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Gee.. I haven’t been let out of the basement the execs keep all the artists in for a hot sec.."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/34
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "What are we doing?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/42
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Oh that's right! This is a dating game!! People usually get to know each other first though, right? I’m new to this whole thing... It’s lonely in the basement."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/50
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "And cold... so cold"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/58
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Anyway! Where to start! We have so much to cover and so little time!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/66
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "This is by far the coolest thing I've ever gotten to be a part of and I'm so thankful to have had even a small part working alongside the most talented, funny and passionate company (even if we were locked in the house’s basement)"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/74
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "I love horror movies. JRPGS.. TTRPGS.. CRPGS.. All the RPGS.. Evenings in with my cat, a good iced latte and loooooong romantic walks down the manga aisle. What else.."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/82
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Oh! I’ve got an encyclopedic knowledge of theme park history, musicals are my guilty pleasure and I can recite more fights from Rupaul’s Drag Race than I can count on one hand!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/90
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "I cry every time I hear the Star Trek main theme and the way to my heart is definitely asking about my D&D character."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/98
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "How do you feel about Muppets???"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/112
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "And do you have a moment to talk about why Tarsem Singh’s 2006 cult classic The Fall is the greatest film ever made?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/123
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Do you like jazz?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/134
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "What’s your opinion on the recent renaming of cantina music in Star Wars canon?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/142
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "This is very important for our relationship going forward..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/153
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "OH MAN I haven’t even touched on animation yet! Should we sit down?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/164
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "...I think I’ve got a steel chair around here somewhere.."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/172/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woah slow down, this is kind of a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/173/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhhhhhh... Tell me about your D&D character?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/174/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why would I care about the lore accurate name of cantina music?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "My bad! There aren't very many people to chat with in the basement, I must have gotten ahead of myself!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-0/18
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "This is why I don't do these kinds of things. Maybe we should grab a coffee and take it slow? We can invite the rest of the art team and have a group hang!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "This is a good path to friendship with Tay!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Only ancient prophecies have foretold this moment.. No one has ever asked me this question before..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-1/15
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Are we about to make out right now?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Offscreen! Offscreen!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-2/15
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "First of all..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-2/23
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "Because it’s called Jizz, unless you’re a coward."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-2/34
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "And second of all.."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-2/42
msgctxt "Tay"
msgid "How dare you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tay/0/27/c-2/59
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Just leave. Tay hates you."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen, script kiddies and coding wizards, gather 'round as we unveil the architect of algorithms, the smasher of bugs, our Lead Engineer Thiago!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/18
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Hey Chap, hey everybody! So happy you're all enjoying our game!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "So Thiago, I've got some questions for you here, let me just... <w>ouch</w>"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/34
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "You ok there Chap?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/42
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "I'm fin.. Mayb.. not. Need hel... *&!(^!Y&*"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/56
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh no! Chap's glitching!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/67
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Great timing... Here I was with my 32-page speech ready..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/75
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Don't just stay there, do something!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/83
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Let's get you fixed pal!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/91
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Should I do something?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/99
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Don't worry about it..."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/107
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Aaaand all set."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/118
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Wow, thanks. I do feel much better."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/129
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "But what happened to the bug?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/140
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's running towards the kitchen!! Help!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/151
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "What should Thiago do with this damn bug?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/159/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's fine. Nothing's perfect anyway, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/160/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotta fix that thing, fast!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/161/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This just means that we'll have a new version - much more to look forward to!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Are you crazy? Things can really go south if you let a bug roam free!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/18
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Would you want our game to... you know?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "No, I don't! What? Is it that horrible?"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/37
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Oh boy, it is. To crash!! That would be the worst outcome! We can't allow that!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/45/b/4
msgctxt "Daemon"
msgid "WE CAN'T ALLOW THAT"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-0/54
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thiago unfortunately hates you for that answer."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Alright my friend, I'm on my way! Thanks for the help there, gotta go now!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-1/24
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "That's the friendly spirit that Thiago enjoys!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-2/7
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Oh yeah, for sure! And who knows, maybe that will end up being a pretty cool DLC!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-2/15
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "Thanks champ. I'll make sure we don't have any of these around here."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-2/23
msgctxt "Thiago"
msgid "And I'm around if you ever need support!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_thiago/0/27/c-2/40
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "Thiago's positivity fills you with love!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/10
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "TJ! A writer extraordinaire!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/18
msgctxt "TJ"
msgid "Howdy! How yinz doing? Who am I? Oh, I’m just a humble writer and theater professor. I teach the kids real good."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/26
msgctxt "Chap"
msgid "TJ is actually quite humble - I've seen it myself."
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/34
msgctxt "TJ"
msgid "There is one movie musical that has a stage adaptation that I love more than any other. I’ve seen it six times!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/42
msgctxt "TJ"
msgid "I’m not obsessed! You are!"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Little Shop of Horrors"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Lion King"
msgstr ""

#: sassy_chap/dev_tj/0/27/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
